+/*
+ * RF2000 I851 CTC V3.0 five-channel DRV8711 hardware support.
+ * Derived from drv8711Init()/drv8711Transmit()/setMotorCurrent() in the
+ * RF Repetier firmware (GPL-3.0-or-later). Part of Grbl.
